      "paragraph_id": "mingshi-2f603db3d81e-p000888",
      "observations": [
        "暴昭官职按校记并列记载；各将的稳定人物键、两卫调动及具体地点待复核。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "batch": "part-02",
      "paragraph_id": "mingshi-2f603db3d81e-p000889",
      "observations": [
