      ]
    },
    {
      "batch": "part-02",
      "paragraph_id": "mingshi-2f603db3d81e-p000890",
      "observations": [
        "倪谅和于谅是本纪所列不同人物，张信与前代同名人物须区分。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "batch": "part-02",
      "paragraph_id": "mingshi-2f603db3d81e-p000891",
      "observations": [
