      ]
    },
    {
      "batch": "part-03",
      "paragraph_id": "mingshi-2f603db3d81e-p000923",
      "observations": [
        "校记据同书卷五等改作淝河，暂保留校后字样，参战者规范身份待核。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "batch": "part-03",
      "paragraph_id": "mingshi-2f603db3d81e-p000924",
      "observations": [
